OL,3,GNEWSA'The march is alive in the minds
OL,4,Aof Jarrow today'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe march by 200 men from Jarrow to
OL,7,FLondon to demand jobs is being
OL,8,Fremembered in an exhibition on its 90th
OL,9,Fanniversary.
OL,11,FSouth Tyneside Council has arranged a
OL,12,Fdisplay of artefacts from the Jarrow
OL,13,FCrusade, featuring photographs,
OL,14,Fpaintings, antiques and information
OL,15,Fdisplays in the Town Hall.
OL,17,FIn 1936, the men marched about 300
OL,18,Fmiles (483km) from Jarrow in protest
OL,19,Fover a lack of investment and
OL,20,Femployment in their area.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
