OL,3,GNEWSA'The march is alive in the minds
OL,4,Aof Jarrow today'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Mayor of South Tyneside, Stan
OL,7,FWildhirt, said he hoped people would
OL,8,Fvisit the exhibition as the march's
OL,9,F"history must resonate today" and its
OL,10,Flegacy was "still alive in the minds of
OL,11,Fthe people of Jarrow".
